        - Output: :math:`(C, W_{out})` or :math:`(N, C, W_{out})`, where

          :math:`W_{out} = W_{in} + \text{padding\_left} + \text{padding\_right}`

    Examples::

        >>> m = nn.ReflectionPad1d(2)
        >>> # xdoctest: +IGNORE_WANT("other tests seem to modify printing styles")
